  "duration": 31.2,
  "vo": "Ten bucks at Chipotle. How much is profit? Chipotle's own 2025 numbers, line by line. Food, drinks and the bag: two ninety-six. Seven bucks profit? Rip-off? Not so fast. The crew: two fifty-one. Almost as much as the food. Rent: fifty-two cents. Down to four-oh-one. Ads, delivery, card fees: a buck forty-seven. The restaurant keeps two fifty-four. Headquarters, depreciation, new stores: ninety-two cents. Then taxes, minus the interest it earns: thirty-three cents. You do the last subtraction. Pause. What's left of your ten? A buck twenty-nine. Rip-off or not?",
